# Copy to desktop/.env (gitignored). Loaded by the Electron main process only;
# the page never sees it. Used to teach new price sources and for the
# set-details fallbacks. Scheduled price refreshes do not use it.
#
# Optional: the app uses the Gemini key shared with your other apps (Windows
# Credential Manager; set it with `npx shop-teacher key set`). A key here is
# moved there at the next start.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
